# Natural English & Symbolic Arithmetic in Mini

assign a to the total of 10 and 5
assign b to the difference of 20 and 8
assign c to the product of 4 and 6
assign d to the quotient of 100 and 4
assign e to the remainder of 17 and 5

show "Total of 10 and 5:", a
show "Difference of 20 and 8:", b
show "Product of 4 and 6:", c
show "Quotient of 100 and 4:", d
show "Remainder of 17 and 5:", e

# Infix English operators
assign score to 10 plus 5 times 2 minus 3
show "10 plus 5 times 2 minus 3 =", score

assign power_val to 2 to the power of 8
show "2 to the power of 8 =", power_val

# Mutating numeric variables
increase score by 13
decrease score by 5
show "Updated score:", score

